      "content": "GREAT MISSENDEN        BALLINGER COMMON SP 90 SW 2/8                                                  (west side)                                                      Crawley Farmhouse                                            II C17, altered and cased in brick C18.  Two storeys.  Chequer pattern brick to front, four first floor and three ground floor, 2-light casements, door on right with plain hood.  Gabled wing on left with one 3-light casement to each floor.  Old tiled roof.  Weatherboarded barn adjoining on right, similar roof.  Modern rear wing. (RCHM I p176 MON.27). Listing NGR: SP9118802833"
    }
